# .agent-relay/bank.conf — optional knowledge-bank config for this repo.
#
# Format: one BANK_KEY=value per line, key at column 0. Whole-line comments
# only (a "# ..." after a value becomes part of the value). The file is parsed
# line by line and never sourced. Full reference: docs/bank.md.
#
# Remove the leading "# " from a key line to turn it on, then run:
#   atry bank check
# and read .agent-relay/bank-status.md.

# --- Obsidian vault (or any plain folder) --------------------------------
# BANK_TYPE: which backend receives notes. Only "obsidian-vault" has a driver.
# BANK_PATH: absolute path to an existing, writable folder. atry never creates
#            it or any subfolder; notes are written flat into it.
# BANK_TYPE=obsidian-vault
# BANK_PATH=/absolute/path/to/your/vault/folder

# --- Project name (optional) ----------------------------------------------
# Lowercase letters and single hyphens, 3-48 characters. Goes into note
# frontmatter/tags and scopes agentmemory. When unset, notes carry no project
# field and atry scopes agentmemory by the repo folder name. Several repos may
# share a name on purpose.
# BANK_PROJECT_NAME=my-project

# --- agentmemory server (optional second sink) ----------------------------
# http(s)://host[:port], no path. Can be used without BANK_TYPE.
# If the server runs with AGENTMEMORY_SECRET, export the same variable in the
# shell that runs atry. Never put the secret in this file.
# Pushing to agentmemory needs python3.
# BANK_AGENTMEMORY_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3111
